$('friendBtn').onclick=openFriend;$('challengeBtn').onclick=startChallenge;$('helpBtn').onclick=()=>{ $('eventBody').innerHTML='<div class="eyebrow">QUICK GUIDE</div><h1>How to become a star</h1><p>Explore the pixel campus with <b>WASD / arrow keys</b>. Find the pink-lit performance platform and press <b>E</b>, or tap <b>START CHALLENGE</b>. During a challenge, press <b>SPACE</b> (or tap the lane) as each note crosses the cyan target. Build combos for judge points and fans.</p><p>Earn fan votes with challenges and variety shows. Make friends for a special bond bonus. Rank through four rounds: <b>50 → 24 → 16 → 10</b>. The top seven form the final group!</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="primary" id="closeGuide">GOT IT</button></div>';showModal('event');$('closeGuide').onclick=()=>hideModal('event')};$('welcomeGuide').onclick=()=>{$('welcome').classList.remove('show');$('helpBtn').click()};$('beginBtn').onclick=()=>{hideModal('welcome');state.started=true;toast('Welcome to Orbit Campus, Jin!')};
